    <div>
      <p begin="00:09.460" end="00:13.660" ttm:agent="v1">One kiss is all it takes</p>
      <p begin="00:13.660" end="00:15.440" ttm:agent="v1">Falling in love with me</p>
      <p begin="00:15.440" end="00:18.010" ttm:agent="v1">Possibilities, I look like all you need</p>
      <p begin="00:18.010" end="00:26.010" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:31.710" end="00:35.770" ttm:agent="v1">Let me take the night, I'll love real easy</p>
      <p begin="00:35.770" end="00:39.010" ttm:agent="v1">And I know that you'll still wanna see me</p>
      <p begin="00:39.010" end="00:42.920" ttm:agent="v1">On the Sunday morning, music real loud</p>
      <p begin="00:42.920" end="00:47.040" ttm:agent="v1">Let me love you while the moon is still out</p>
      <p begin="00:47.040" end="00:54.140" ttm:agent="v1">Something in you, lit up Heaven in me</p>
      <p begin="00:54.140" end="00:58.210" ttm:agent="v1">The feeling won't let me sleep</p>
      <p begin="00:58.210" end="01:02.550" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm lost in the way you move</p>
      <p begin="01:02.550" end="01:04.780" ttm:agent="v1">The way you feel</p>
