      <p begin="01:14.520" end="01:19.020" ttm:agent="v1">Possibilities, I look like all you need</p>
      <p begin="01:19.020" end="01:27.020" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:34.660" end="01:39.170" ttm:agent="v1">I just want to feel your skin on mine</p>
      <p begin="01:39.170" end="01:43.350" ttm:agent="v1">Feel your eyes do the exploring</p>
      <p begin="01:43.350" end="01:46.760" ttm:agent="v1">Passion in the message when you smile</p>
      <p begin="01:46.760" end="01:48.700" ttm:agent="v1">Take my time</p>
      <p begin="01:48.700" end="01:56.170" ttm:agent="v1">Something in you, lit up Heaven in me</p>
